; Import library definition for the kernel32 entry points HYPRLODR uses.
; Converted to a .lib by llvm-dlltool in tools/build_windows.sh.
LIBRARY KERNEL32.dll
EXPORTS
CreateDirectoryA
CreateEventA
CreateFileA
CreateFileW
CreateThread
CreateToolhelp32Snapshot
DisableThreadLibraryCalls
ExitProcess
FindClose
FindFirstFileA
FindNextFileA
InterlockedCompareExchange
InterlockedExchange
FreeLibrary
GetCommandLineA
GetCurrentProcessId
GetCurrentThreadId
GetEnvironmentVariableA
GetProcessHeap
GetTickCount
GetModuleFileNameA
GetFileSize
SetFilePointerEx
GetModuleHandleA
GetProcAddress
GetStdHandle
HeapAlloc
HeapFree
HeapReAlloc
LoadLibraryA
Module32First
Module32Next
MultiByteToWideChar
ReadFile
WideCharToMultiByte
VirtualProtect
VirtualAlloc
GetCurrentProcess
FlushInstructionCache
VirtualQuery
SetUnhandledExceptionFilter
SetEvent
Sleep
WaitForSingleObject
WriteFile
CloseHandle
